    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark Galaxy is an action based rogue-like top-down shooter. You pilot a space drone to oppose the insectoid like species called Minaripods. Illuminate the darkness and get stronger by travelling to different star systems. Can you free our galaxy from the invaders? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2532830/extras/60a3e070a1fa4a98f6d10844c6c68be4.avif?t=1749579412\" /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel to dozens of unique star systems and slay all enemies to continue the journey across the galaxy\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The arena layout changes after the first wave - adapt and don't lose track of your surroundings\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use a variety of weapons and specials and rise to the challenge of mastering your kill efficiency\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Install chips to gain special traits\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customise the appearance of your space drone </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2532830/extras/abff13e7af04cbd0fbfa705d5f132664.avif?t=1749579412\" /></span>The war has begun as our galaxy was invaded by an army of insectoid like creatures called Minaripods. They are an aggressive species, guided by their instincts to kill all other life forms. In these times, space travel is nearly impossible - they create an unknown dark substance which reduces the visibility in our galaxy. Minaripods reproduce rapidly, so you have to exterminate them in one go. Luckily you have unlimited tries for this mission - you safely telecontrol your drone far away from the battlefield. Embark on an epic journey to illuminate the darkness!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark Galaxy is an action based rogue-like top-down shooter. You pilot a space drone to oppose the insectoid like species called Minaripods. Illuminate the darkness and get stronger by travelling to different star systems. Can you free our galaxy from the invaders? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2532830/extras/60a3e070a1fa4a98f6d10844c6c68be4.avif?t=1749579412\" /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel to dozens of unique star systems and slay all enemies to continue the journey across the galaxy\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The arena layout changes after the first wave - adapt and don't lose track of your surroundings\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use a variety of weapons and specials and rise to the challenge of mastering your kill efficiency\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Install chips to gain special traits\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customise the appearance of your space drone </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2532830/extras/abff13e7af04cbd0fbfa705d5f132664.avif?t=1749579412\" /></span>The war has begun as our galaxy was invaded by an army of insectoid like creatures called Minaripods. They are an aggressive species, guided by their instincts to kill all other life forms. In these times, space travel is nearly impossible - they create an unknown dark substance which reduces the visibility in our galaxy. Minaripods reproduce rapidly, so you have to exterminate them in one go. Luckily you have unlimited tries for this mission - you safely telecontrol your drone far away from the battlefield. Embark on an epic journey to illuminate the darkness!</p>",
